["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Dataset/hasSensitivePersonalInformation", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Describes if any sensitive personal information is present in the dataset.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
